# Adapter Models Belong in UAC

RULE: Every `_<venue>_models.py`, `_<venue>_schema.py`, or any Pydantic model that parses an external API response
must live in `unified-api-contracts/unified_api_contracts_external/<venue>/schemas.py`. The "private" `_` prefix does
NOT exempt a model from this rule. If a class parses an external API response, it belongs in UAC regardless of where
it currently lives.

WHY: Adapter-private models ARE external API schemas. Keeping them in interface adapter directories means:
- Schema definitions scatter across interface repos with no single authority
- VCR cassettes and test mocks cannot reference a stable canonical location
- Normalizers cannot import the raw schema without circular dependency risk
- Auditing external API coverage becomes impossible

CODEX: 02-data/contracts-scope-and-layout.md
AUDIT: plans/archive/SCHEMA_CONTRACTS_AUDIT.md Section 3a

DO:
  # External API response model: define in UAC
  # unified-api-contracts/unified_api_contracts_external/deribit/schemas.py
  class DeribitOrderBookResponse(BaseModel):
      instrument_name: str
      bids: list[list[float]]
      asks: list[list[float]]
      timestamp: int

  # Interface adapter: import from UAC
  from unified_api_contracts.unified_api_contracts_external.deribit.schemas import DeribitOrderBookResponse

NEVER:
  # Do NOT define API response models inside interface adapter directories
  # unified-market-interface/adapters/_deribit_models.py  <-- VIOLATION
  class DeribitOrderBookResponse(BaseModel):  # belongs in UAC, not here
      ...

CURRENT KNOWN VIOLATIONS (must migrate to UAC):
  - None. All known _<venue>_models.py stubs have been eliminated.
  - Any new _<venue>_models.py appearing in an interface adapter directory is an immediate VIOLATION.

RESOLVED VIOLATIONS:
  - unified-market-interface: _deribit_models.py → UAC deribit/schemas.py ✅
  - unified-market-interface: _defi_graph_models.py → UAC thegraph/schemas.py ✅
  - execution-service (sports adapters, formerly unified-sports-execution-interface): _matchbook_models.py, _smarkets_models.py, _betdaq_models.py, _pinnacle_models.py, _odds_api_models.py, _onexbet_models.py → UAC sports venue schemas ✅

MIGRATION TARGET: unified_api_contracts_external/<venue>/schemas.py
